DESCRIPTION:Hybrid Club | Global Bass Datum: 21.11.2026 | Einlass: 21:00 Uhr Beginn: 21:00 | Ende: 03:00 Uhr  €10 POLYCHAOS DUBIUM  is an event series dedicated to Hybrid Club Music and Global Bass. Breaking genre boundaries\, the series crafts a high-energy\, percussive journey through Gqom\, Baile Funk\, Neo Perreo\, Kuduro\, Batida\, Jersey Club\, Jungle\, Juke\, Ghettotech\, Guaracha\, Footwork\, breakcore\, electro\, and experimental sounds. The second edition features a CRT TV / tube television installation by visual artist Nova.psd\, alongside object and light installations by Qualia and Ironica Los Culos.  For each night\, dedicated artists collaborate\, experiment\, and perform live together. Lineup: DJ Gawdesque DJ Anxxxious_ t  DJ Kmanxak  DJ Ironica Los Culos VJ: Nova.psd  Lights & Objects: Qualia\, Ironica Los Culos Veranstalter: IRONICA & QUALIA
